Block Runner for Horizon 26.3 (version 0.4.0)

A port of Block Runner 8.0.4 by Fuzs.
Original source: https://github.com/Fuzss/blockrunner
Original licence: MPL-2.0

Ported to Horizon by lavoide: the rules are re-implemented in Rust on Horizon's mod API (no Java
code is included). This port is distributed under the same licence as the original (MPL-2.0); the licence text is in LICENSE. Built
against Horizon's exact-build SDK dd67b76ff23e28c6d8e21859df600d31572f81a0.

The original's assets licence (LICENSE-ASSETS.md, All Rights Reserved) doesn't apply: this package
carries no assets from it.
